Hermes Installer
================

This project is an unofficial, community-maintained installer wrapper for
Hermes Agent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Nous Research.

This tool does not redistribute Hermes Agent or Electron. At runtime it
downloads and drives the official Hermes installer and uses the installed
Hermes CLI. The following third-party projects are used or downloaded:

  Hermes Agent
    Project: https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) Nous Research

  Electron
    Project: https://github.com/electron/electron
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) Electron contributors / OpenJS Foundation

  electron-builder
    Project: https://github.com/electron-userland/electron-builder
    License: MIT

  uv (Astral)
    Project: https://github.com/astral-sh/uv
    License: MIT OR Apache-2.0

  .NET Framework / WinForms
    Microsoft Corporation, subject to the Microsoft .NET Framework license.

Mirror endpoints used by default (not owned by this project):

  https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/   (official)
  https://ghproxy.net/                     (git proxy)
  https://npmmirror.com/                   (Electron / npm mirrors)
  https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/       (PyPI mirror)

The hosts workaround is opt-in, requires administrator approval, backs up the
existing hosts file, and can be reverted from the application.

